answers.approach:
Clear the claims, not ads —
generate from approved parts;
review only seams.

Don’t build one checker to bless every claim;
Bind copy, rights, and approved proof by name.

Have machines rank doubt; let reviewers say no;
Hold regulated claims, let safe templates flow.

Keep disclosures in sidecars when metadata strays;
Test every handoff through serving pathways.

Brand meaning and law stay beyond perfect sight;
We’ll learn where we fail, not solve it tonight.
